DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
SUMMARY:▲ Long easy run 9 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base…
DESCRIPTION:Long easy run 9 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base is the lever 
 - the fastest runners get there on Zone 1 volume.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-e
 ntry\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical
  jump comes back about 18 days after an ultra\, which is Thursday\, so t
 he running is all easy and the first box jumps start low. Durability is 
 the through-line of the whole block: long sessions over 90 min are what 
 preserve running economy under fatigue\, which is the 70.3 run leg in on
 e sentence.\n160 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
