DTSTAMP:20261112T063838Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:○ BIKE 30 min
DESCRIPTION:BIKE 30 min - sweet spot\, 2 x 8 min at 88-93% FTP (~132-140 
 W)\, 4 min easy between\, the rest as warm-up and cool-down. The 90 km b
 ike is over half a 70.3 by time.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. V
 ertical jump comes back about 18 days after an ultra\, which is Thursday
 \, so the running is all easy and the first box jumps start low. Durabil
 ity is the through-line of the whole block: long sessions over 90 min ar
 e what preserve running economy under fatigue\, which is the 70.3 run le
 g in one sentence.\n157 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:venice703winterbase-w1-s4-swim@garmin-training
