 der target. This sets every pace for the block.\n\nWeek 2 of 11 - Re-ent
 ry\nRE-ENTRY. 5 KM RETEST Tuesday - it sets every pace below. Nothing el
 se hard.\n151 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
