BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:venice703winterbase-w3-s0-long@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261112T063838Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:▲ Long easy run 10 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base…
DESCRIPTION:Long easy run 10 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base is the lever
  - the fastest runners get there on Zone 1 volume. LONG RUN WITH A THRES
 HOLD FINISH: last 10 min at threshold EFFORT - HR 175-180\, pace 5:25-5:
 35/km. Only 10 min this week: with Tuesday's 4 x 1 km it puts quality at
  about 23% of the week\, inside the 20-25% cap.\n\nWeek 3 of 11 - Thresh
 old\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nTHRESHOLD BLOCK ope
 ns. Pfitzinger's order: threshold first\, VO2max later in the block. Two
  quality touches this week - Tuesday's session and a threshold finish on
  the long run. Quality volume stays inside 20-25% of weekly mileage\, wh
 ich is the Norwegian rule and the one that keeps this repeatable.\n146 d
 ays to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
