UID:venice703winterbase-w3-s2-strides@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261112T063838Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:THRESHOLD 4 x 1 km at threshold EFFORT (55 min)
DESCRIPTION:THRESHOLD 4 x 1 km at threshold EFFORT - HR 175-180\, pace 5:
 25-5:35/km. This is triangulated\, not guessed: your 1 Sep 4 x 4 min ran
  5:27/5:12/5:20/5:23 at HR 175-178\, and VDOT off the time trial indepen
 dently lands on 5:30. Re-anchor after each retest\, 90 s jog. First qual
 ity session of the block - deliberately conservative. Warm up 15 min + 4
  x 100 m AT 5:15/km and no faster\, cool down 10 min.\n\nWeek 3 of 11 - 
 Threshold\nTHRESHOLD BLOCK opens. Pfitzinger's order: threshold first\, 
 VO2max later in the block. Two quality touches this week - Tuesday's ses
 sion and a threshold finish on the long run. Quality volume stays inside
  20-25% of weekly mileage\, which is the Norwegian rule and the one that
  keeps this repeatable.\n144 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
