 OI line item in the whole season. You cannot self-coach a catch you have
  never felt.\n\nWeek 4 of 11 - Threshold\nTHRESHOLD. Sub-threshold means
  controlled\, not max. If you cannot finish the last rep at the same pac
 e as the first\, you ran the first too fast.\n136 days to Venice 70.3 (w
 inter base).
