BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:venice703winterbase-w8-s0-long@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261112T063838Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270104
SUMMARY:▲ Long easy run 14 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base…
DESCRIPTION:Long easy run 14 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base is the lever
  - the fastest runners get there on Zone 1 volume. LONG RUN WITH A THRES
 HOLD FINISH: last 15 min at threshold EFFORT - HR 175-180\, pace 5:25-5:
 35/km. This is triangulated\, not guessed: your 1 Sep 4 x 4 min ran 5:27
 /5:12/5:20/5:23 at HR 175-178\, and VDOT off the time trial independentl
 y lands on 5:30. Re-anchor after each retest. This is one of the four pr
 imary ways to move a lactate threshold\, and it doubles as durability wo
 rk - running at pace on pre-fatigued legs is the 70.3 run leg.\n\nWeek 8
  of 11 - Build\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nBUILD. S
 econd VO2max week - longer reps\, one fewer. No taper: there is no race 
 until Venice\, so the block runs straight on to next week's down week.\n
 111 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
