DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270106
SUMMARY:VO2MAX 4 x 4 min at VO2max EFFORT (11 km)
DESCRIPTION:VO2MAX 4 x 4 min at VO2max EFFORT - provisional pace 5:05-5:2
 0/km\, HR at the END of each rep 186-193. HR lags 60-90 s so it cannot s
 teer a 3 min rep\; set it by pace\, confirm by the HR you finish on\, 3 
 min jog. Longer reps\, one fewer. Warm up 15 min\, cool down 10 min.\n\n
 Week 8 of 11 - Build\nBUILD. Second VO2max week - longer reps\, one fewe
 r. No taper: there is no race until Venice\, so the block runs straight 
 on to next week's down week.\n109 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
