DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270107
SUMMARY:○ BIKE 40 min
DESCRIPTION:BIKE 40 min - sweet spot\, 3 x 8 min at 88-93% FTP (~132-140 
 W)\, 3 min easy between\, the rest as warm-up and cool-down. The 90 km b
 ike is over half a 70.3 by time.\n\nWeek 8 of 11 - Build\nBUILD. Second 
 VO2max week - longer reps\, one fewer. No taper: there is no race until 
 Venice\, so the block runs straight on to next week's down week.\n108 da
 ys to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
