DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
SUMMARY:○ BIKE 90 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady.…
DESCRIPTION:BIKE 90 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady. Non-impact aerobi
 c volume - the cheapest fitness available and it spares the shins. Over 
 75 min\, take 40-60 g carb per hour from the start - early gut practice 
 for Venice.\n\nWeek 8 of 11 - Build\nBUILD. Second VO2max week - longer 
 reps\, one fewer. No taper: there is no race until Venice\, so the block
  runs straight on to next week's down week.\n105 days to Venice 70.3 (wi
 nter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
