SUMMARY:Strength UPPER (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER - push and pull as one session\, 45 min. Rows\
 , pull-ups\, overhead press\, rear delts. Heavy\, 4-6 reps\, not hypertr
 ophy ranges. Free against the running and cycling load. Dead hangs 3 x m
 ax at the end - grip is a genuine weakness at 32-36 s.\n\nWeek 10 of 11 
 - Bridge\nBRIDGE to Venice. Durability leads: the long run and the bike 
 carry the block from here\, and the running holds rather than builds.\n9
 6 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
