SUMMARY:▲ Long easy run 14 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base…
DESCRIPTION:Long easy run 14 km\, HR under 158. Aerobic base is the lever
  - the fastest runners get there on Zone 1 volume. No threshold finish t
 his week - Tuesday's session already spends the quality budget\, and qua
 lity volume stays inside 20-25% of weekly mileage.\n\nWeek 11 of 11 - Br
 idge\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nBRIDGE. Last week 
 before the Venice block opens 31 Jan. Saturday's 2.5 h ride is the longe
 st of the winter and sets up the 60 km opener.\n90 days to Venice 70.3 (
 winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
