 bike is over half a 70.3 by time.\n\nWeek 11 of 11 - Bridge\nBRIDGE. Las
 t week before the Venice block opens 31 Jan. Saturday's 2.5 h ride is th
 e longest of the winter and sets up the 60 km opener.\n87 days to Venice
