DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270131
SUMMARY:○ BIKE 150 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady.…
DESCRIPTION:BIKE 150 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady. Non-impact aerob
 ic volume - the cheapest fitness available and it spares the shins. Over
  75 min\, take 40-60 g carb per hour from the start - early gut practice
  for Venice.\n\nWeek 11 of 11 - Bridge\nBRIDGE. Last week before the Ven
 ice block opens 31 Jan. Saturday's 2.5 h ride is the longest of the wint
 er and sets up the 60 km opener.\n84 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
